WEBVTT

00:00.170 --> 00:01.070
My name is Lily.

00:01.350 --> 00:03.590
I’m a photographer, retoucher, otherwise

00:03.670 --> 00:07.210
entrepreneur, vagabond, and I’m someone

00:07.270 --> 00:08.910
who has a million ideas all at once,

00:08.970 --> 00:11.250
and when I try to execute them, I do

00:11.310 --> 00:13.029
a lot of things really well at 10%,

00:13.169 --> 00:15.050
and this weekend has given me the tools

00:15.110 --> 00:16.570
to get to 100%

00:17.210 --> 00:19.110
on so many things that have been bogging

00:19.130 --> 00:20.990
me down for more than months.

00:21.210 --> 00:23.610
And the relief I’ve felt is tremendous.
